> [T]rying to find a way to say "thank you[" to] someone special?
Need a gift for someone who has everything?
Want to celebrate a speical occassion but unsure what type of gift is best?
Your gift to the Foundation is a great way to honor someone by giving to the fund of your choice[ in] that person's name.

